    <briefdescription>
<para>Simple molecular dynamics optimizer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The particles to be optimized must have optimizable x,y,z attributes and a non-optimizable mass attribute; this optimizer assumes the score to be energy in kcal/mol, the xyz coordinates to be in angstroms, and the mass to be in AMU (g/mol).</para>
<para>Particles without optimized x,y,z and nonoptimized mass are skipped. <simplesect kind="see"><para>VelocityScalingOptimizerState </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>LangevinThermostatOptimizerState </para>
</simplesect>
